Z||000000||DecadenceR||07-25-2001||02:11 PM||||I was pulling into Wawa, and I almost pissed myself laughing. There was a Honda Prelude sitting in the parking lot, with the typical exhaust, big wing, huge rims, single wiper on the windshield...<BR>BUt the thing that really got me going was the stickers he had. Across the hood and left fender was "RICED", and across the windshiled was "RICED OUT RACING". <BR>I actually talked to the guy that owned it, and he was pretty cool. Turns out it started as a big joke between him and his friends. but he bought the car, fell in love with it, and tricked it out. <BR>He's from NY but has family in teh area and says sometimes he takes it to Englishtown Raceway. So if any of you go there, keep an eye out for this gar...||||reg||1
